                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7a2cd7a4-1791-40bd-a661-fa9f5537252a",
                        "source_entry_id": "3503923f-5817-3b7f-a6f4-994175773ff0",
                        "source_sense_id": "5e5e2048-df19-361a-979a-2b5852579a1d",
                        "target_lang_word": "presence",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "presence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "717fe084-9444-3aef-bcd8-8a30dccb2072",
                                        "entry_id": "f83c9abc-c26e-339e-a2fa-f6ebf88e0ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fact or condition of being present, or of being within sight or call, or at hand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35a2241e-7c5c-4a24-938c-aef9b7bb6978",
                                                "sense_id": "717fe084-9444-3aef-bcd8-8a30dccb2072",
                                                "text": "Any painter can benefit from the presence of a live model from which to draw."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "954563cb-e3c2-448e-93e9-5000e4c26381",
                                                "sense_id": "717fe084-9444-3aef-bcd8-8a30dccb2072",
                                                "text": "Carried somehow, somewhither, for some reason, on these surging floods, were these travelers, of errand not wholly obvious to their fellows, yet of such sort as to call into query alike the nature of their errand and their own relations. It is easily earned repetition to state that Josephine St. Auban's was a presence not to be concealed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c259faee-81ab-3b5a-a642-cb4ad0eb2ab4",
                                        "entry_id": "f83c9abc-c26e-339e-a2fa-f6ebf88e0ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The part of space within one's immediate vicinity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2783610-2296-4db7-b6d2-9b096d2af6e8",
                                                "sense_id": "c259faee-81ab-3b5a-a642-cb4ad0eb2ab4",
                                                "text": "Bob never said anything about it in my presence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f723414-5e1a-39c6-9ab8-29c0ac18af2e",
                                        "entry_id": "f83c9abc-c26e-339e-a2fa-f6ebf88e0ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A quality of poise and effectiveness that enables a performer to achieve a close relationship with their audience."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a581e72c-b7f2-3ffa-8532-b1667d50eb87",
                                        "entry_id": "f83c9abc-c26e-339e-a2fa-f6ebf88e0ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A quality that sets an individual out from others; a quality that makes them noticed and/or admired even if they are not speaking or performing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ff34905-8d10-4c42-9bfc-84429340a373",
                                                "sense_id": "a581e72c-b7f2-3ffa-8532-b1667d50eb87",
                                                "text": "Despite being less than five foot, she filled up the theatre with her stage presence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40c8e156-7c19-47e1-b1ff-3125a1f291bb",
                                                "sense_id": "a581e72c-b7f2-3ffa-8532-b1667d50eb87",
                                                "text": "Perrin Ferris succeeds in his equally demanding task of maintaining some semblance of presence while sharing the stage with a chronic upstager."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a57c60b1-d5ff-3ab4-86e3-00307b934201",
                                        "entry_id": "f83c9abc-c26e-339e-a2fa-f6ebf88e0ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something (as a spirit) felt or believed to be present."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20c535ab-6c63-49ae-b74d-eb796d5ec4a5",
                                                "sense_id": "a57c60b1-d5ff-3ab4-86e3-00307b934201",
                                                "text": "I'm convinced that there was a presence in that building that I can't explain, which led to my heroic actions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3001016-207b-3083-9d37-8f7ecce24fdc",
                                        "entry_id": "f83c9abc-c26e-339e-a2fa-f6ebf88e0ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A company's business activity in a particular market."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "988ea43f-ccaa-3b11-83f4-f75b1ebdda00",
                                        "entry_id": "f83c9abc-c26e-339e-a2fa-f6ebf88e0ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An assembly of great persons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ddcbeeb-4b60-35cb-97d1-0445e58d1e4a",
                                        "entry_id": "f83c9abc-c26e-339e-a2fa-f6ebf88e0ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being closely focused on the here and now, not distracted by irrelevant thoughts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58eda833-3f09-3cf6-83e4-75ec613c5e5b",
                                        "entry_id": "f83c9abc-c26e-339e-a2fa-f6ebf88e0ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of room tone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "presence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a18d7b71-8078-3bc2-a55a-124964b6d7d9",
                                        "entry_id": "9e756e52-156c-3c0f-827a-74fe4e7dc572",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make or become present."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80eae57d-45ef-446f-96d0-b05690d99b5e",
                                                "sense_id": "a18d7b71-8078-3bc2-a55a-124964b6d7d9",
                                                "text": "Presence means: the constant abiding that approaches man, reaches him, is extended to him. But what is this source of this extending reach to which the present belongs as presencing, insofar as there is presence? True, man always remains approached by the presencing of something actually present without explicitly heeding presencing itself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee375990-3a52-4e58-a190-5b9179cba37b",
                                                "sense_id": "a18d7b71-8078-3bc2-a55a-124964b6d7d9",
                                                "text": "Within a completely neutral horizon, the primordial continuous stream of experience is presenced without interruption. As this time, the past and future have no meaning apart from the now in which they are presenced."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46140f22-1e91-498e-b511-457257b56411",
                                                "sense_id": "a18d7b71-8078-3bc2-a55a-124964b6d7d9",
                                                "text": "Just as the bread and butter can be presenced as more than just the bread and the butter, so baking a loaf of bread can be more than just the baking, the baker, and the bread."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9ac3057-7324-4cfb-9594-dac8613b5c5e",
                                                "sense_id": "a18d7b71-8078-3bc2-a55a-124964b6d7d9",
                                                "text": "2005, James Phillips, Heidegger's Volk: Between National Socialism and Poetry, Stanford University Press, →ISBN (paperback), page 118,\nFrom the overtaxing of the regime's paranoiac classifications and monitoring of the social field, Heidegger was to await in vain the presencing of that which is present, the revelation of the Being of beings in its precedence to governmental control."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0f5374a-5b07-4e73-8b82-fe13bae45ded",
                                                "sense_id": "a18d7b71-8078-3bc2-a55a-124964b6d7d9",
                                                "text": "Benner (1984) captures the essence of this when she describes presencing as the art of 'being with' a person without the need to be 'doing to' the person."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a1bccacf-775f-4b36-8f62-86baa7b2def2",
                        "source_entry_id": "3503923f-5817-3b7f-a6f4-994175773ff0",
                        "source_sense_id": "5e5e2048-df19-361a-979a-2b5852579a1d",
